QAP - Quansheng Airband Project
PU5XRM Quansheng Airband Scanner Firmware

This product includes software developed as part of the Quansheng UV-K5
open firmware ecosystem. The firmware in this repository is derived from,
and builds upon, the following projects:

- DualTachyon / uv-k5-firmware
  https://github.com/DualTachyon/uv-k5-firmware
  (original implementation, Apache License 2.0)

- OneOfEleven / uv-k5-firmware-custom
  https://github.com/OneOfEleven/uv-k5-firmware-custom

- egzumer / uv-k5-firmware-custom
  https://github.com/egzumer/uv-k5-firmware-custom

- miramir / uv-k5-firmware
  https://github.com/miramir/uv-k5-firmware
  (base fork used by this project)

- armel / F4HWN uv-k5-firmware-custom (if applicable)
  https://github.com/armel/uv-k5-firmware-custom

The web tooling/UI concepts reference the work of:
- egzumer / uvtools
  https://egzumer.github.io/uvtools/
- iu2frl / uvtools-frl
  https://iu2frl.github.io/uvtools-frl/

